{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_11_level_main_11-12_end","groupId":"main_11","stageId":"main_11-12","title":"一場相見","storyCode":"11-14","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_11-12_end.txt","sourceHash":"a90127499839d6e88d487adf6728362288dd8e610c42d5b032be340ba8f07d6b","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_g8_kingrestpath"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這就是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"巨大的門扉橫亙在地下空間之中，除了眾人的呼吸，沒有一點聲音。\n當然，死亡總是寂靜的，再輝煌的王權都不能改變這一點。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......諸王長眠之所。字面意思......是列王的墳墓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們聽到什麼了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有，除了我們幾個的呼吸聲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"毫無疑問，有什麼聲音正在這個空間中回蕩。\n那是夢醒的呢喃，還是疲憊的呻吟？\n他們在注視著自己。\n“維多利亞”在注視著自己。\n當她清楚地感受到這一點的時候，一種煩躁油然而生。\n他們在期待什麼？他們在為自己構想一種怎樣的未來？\n她早就膩煩了被這些所追逐的日子。\n她也已經很久沒有理會那隻如黃金一般的生物的呼喚了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧，儘快完成這個任務。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島和自救軍會需要我們幫忙的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"停下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"地上的這些......是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......光線太暗，一開始我還以為是什麼上流社會的新奇裝飾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些是血。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有交戰的痕跡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一場無比慘烈的戰鬥......不，這是一片浸透死亡的泥潭。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"血跡。蜿蜒的血跡，一路爬行至道路盡頭的門縫背後，又或者，是從那扇巨大的門後爬出來的。\n它們早已乾涸，只留下暗紅色的扭曲殘漬，覆蓋在破碎的磚石之上。\n被一同覆蓋的，還有殘損的箭頭，刀劍的碎片，法術轟擊留下的深坑。\n還有一些更為巨大的痕跡，如同一道道能撕扯開此處靜謐的傷疤，裸露在神聖的大門上。\n雖然附近沒有留下任何一具屍體，但所有經歷過戰場的人都能輕易地想像出這裡曾經發生過什麼。\n兩群人抱著必死的信念而戰，很顯然，他們都遂了願。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從血跡顏色來看，好幾年前的事了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幾年前......難道是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是薩卡茲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"死在這裡的是薩卡茲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我能認出他們的武器。這些武器......與當年襲擊塔樓騎士的薩卡茲戰士使用的是同一批。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......與現在外面的薩卡茲士兵用的不同。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是不一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薩卡茲後來佩戴的刀劍都是海布里區的軍工廠裡造出來的，和維多利亞軍隊用的制式武器很接近。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它們沒這麼粗糙。也遠遠沒有......這麼野蠻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還記得......這些生銹的刀砍向我同僚的身體的聲音。它們很重，在劈裂甲胄之前，會先震斷骨頭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"達格達，你還好嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我沒事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果僅僅只是看見這些痕跡就會讓我止步不前的話，我大概無法度過逃離倫蒂尼姆後的任何一個夜晚。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......維娜，情況出乎我們的意料。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"那些聲音攪得她頭痛。\n他們在催促。他們在訴說。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"諸王之息還在裡面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"保持冷靜，繼續前行。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_g8_kingrestpath"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"與這些薩卡茲戰鬥的人是誰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無法判斷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"另一方沒有留下任何痕跡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也有可能是我沒有見過的痕跡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鉛踝先生，你當雇傭兵多久了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"差一個月十四年。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你一定見過出產自大部分國家地區的武器。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"見過，但見不全。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是個普通的雇傭兵，沒怎麼見過各國精銳部隊的武器。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是見過的話，我活不到現在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"摩根，因陀羅，你們退回到通道之外警戒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就像以前一樣，確保撤退的線路，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但願我不會錯過什麼精彩的橋段。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"推進之王，我們不能貿然繼續前進......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你能聽到發生在我們頭頂的戰鬥嗎，達格達？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我聽不見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我能。這樣的震動......我能想像得到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不能空著手回去，達格達。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果這把劍能阻止這一切，哪怕僅僅只是讓犧牲與屠戮的腳步放緩些......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我就會去做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不會把這視為責任，這只是......一次小小的行動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"和敲掉來找麻煩的打手的門牙沒什麼不同。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"維娜......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿勒黛，你說的。走到這一步以後，我們已經不剩下什麼回頭的機會了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g7_subway"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看起來不是很痛快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿，這可是在王宮地下打架的機會！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但願他們不會遇到什麼要動手的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，我可是為了你做了如此之大的犧牲啊。萬一你被人一箭放倒，總得有個人替你大喊一聲吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，我的傻漢娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你還記得第一次見到維娜的時候，她的樣子嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼不記得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她呀，拽得要命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明明那時候她個子小小的，脾氣卻很大，不怎麼愛說話。你甚至看不出她很生氣，可她動起手來..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"...哈哈，你說都是誰教會她打架的啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她說是她的老師。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我原來以為她的老師是諾伯特區的哪位鬥毆大王。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"後來知道了維娜的出身，倒是說得通了，大概那位老師是個連腦子裡都塞滿了肌肉的騎士吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說真的，王子啊公主什麼的不都是穿著繡花裙跑都跑不快的類型嗎？什麼樣的老師會教她跟野獸似的打架啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，她第一次跟我們坦白身份的時候，我還以為她在開玩笑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"維娜才不會在這種關係到我們生死的問題上說笑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原本我還以為只是些新崛起的幫派，想找我們格拉斯哥幫的麻煩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"結果是針對王位繼承人的滅口行動？哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那幫傢伙的拳頭倒確實很硬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我當時覺得，陪著一位王儲冒險說不定比混跡街頭刺激得多，更何況，這位王儲還深得我心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然後不知不覺地，我們就跟著維娜逃出倫蒂尼姆，跟著她四處流浪，又跟著她回到這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在......如果傳奇裡的英雄有得選，他們更樂意窩在沙發上喝一大口冰啤酒，不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......後悔了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼可能，我們都已經走到這了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的回憶錄都開了頭了，我還想拿它大賺特賺一筆呢！《偉大的維娜陛下和她偉大的朋友們》，只差出版商找上門了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就你肚子裡那點可憐的詞？算了吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"維娜說了，挺好看的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在想......那間被我們砸壞了招牌的酒吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那可是維娜帶著我們打的第一場勝仗！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那天晚上我們把酒窖裡的貨都喝光了。最後是貝爾德把我們一個接一個地背到卡車上，趁著警察過來之前，帶著我們逃回了家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"混蛋，你又記錯了。背你的人分明是老子，貝爾德自己喝得以為馬桶是方向盤，你讓她開車試試？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......哈哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想的只是......不管在什麼地方，我們都還能像過去那樣，聚在一起做出點名堂對吧？哪怕只是從別的幫派那裡搶到一個酒吧也好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"漢娜，你說......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回來這麼多天了，為什麼維娜一次都沒有主動提起過，要回格拉斯哥幫看看啊？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_g8_kingrestpath"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......鑰匙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"臨行之前，博士給了我這把鑰匙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士說，這是凱爾希醫生透過談判得到的......只有它能打開我們面前這扇通往諸王長眠之所的門。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，我手中的這把鑰匙曾經屬於一位德拉克。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......阿勒黛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道......另一把鑰匙在哪裡嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"另一把鑰匙。\n屬於阿斯蘭王室的鑰匙，也能打開面前的這扇門。本該由她的父親交到她手上，她卻從未見過那把鑰匙的模樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......為什麼突然問起這個？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我剛剛想起來，關於那把......諸王之息的另一個傳說。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的祖先......曾經差點殺死一位德拉克王。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而我此刻正拿著紅龍後裔的鑰匙......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"打開這扇通往諸王長眠之所的門。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......在這裡，無論是德拉克還是阿斯蘭——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們都只是維多利亞。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"門開了。\n這比她想像得更輕鬆，輕鬆到彷彿一切都早已準備好，只等著她這個輕輕的動作。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_g9_kingrest"},{"type":"narration","text":"在諸王長眠之所——\n維多利亞千年的歷史正奔向她，奔向離去又歸來的阿斯蘭。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
